# Trivy filesystem-scan exceptions.
#
# CVE-2026-112366 (picomatch ReDoS, CVSS 7.5): unpatched upstream as of this
# writing — affects every picomatch release through 4.0.7, so npm cannot
# resolve to a fixed version. picomatch reaches this repo only as a
# transitive build-time dependency of Docusaurus tooling (micromatch,
# chokidar, anymatch, jest-worker) used while building/serving the docs
# site; it never processes attacker-supplied glob patterns at runtime in a
# deployed service. Remove this line once an upstream fix is available and
# `npm audit` can resolve to it.
